{"id":"vod_md_5841","vodId":"5841","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"我的百合乃工作是也","name_cn":"我的百合乃工作是也","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231010-1/35727bcf4c3947bbea21e80e2825522a.jpg"},"summary":"《#我的百合乃工作是也#》是未幡创作在日本一讯社出版的以描述女性之间复杂情感的题材为主的漫画。近日，该漫画宣布TV动画化~《#我的百合乃工作是也#》首次在2017年一月连载于《comic百合姬》第48期，并且持续连载。在中国，本漫画被以《#百合是我的工作！#》的译名于东立出版社出版。【简介】这是发生在一家以“上演美丽优雅的女子校园生活”为主题的主题咖啡厅中的故事。白木阳芽，一个在平时生活中就擅长利用自己美貌和演技来获得他人好感的一个女子高中生，因为意外被该咖啡厅店长御子柴舞骗入咖啡厅中上班。由此，一场围绕各个角色的是“真实情感”和“表演情感”争端误解开始爆发。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-10 09:26:15","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/wKqhoeje/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/T8iJJ1tD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/WLPo5VJc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/GjBtgVvV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/tT4GnGLZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/MDbdiv4l/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/exxqV7kJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/thGbQPs8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/8Ot7yDM5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/ZbZX3TUT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/g7WXqMBh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/RoGsympp/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:51.332Z"}